# The mirror is gitignored -- it is someone's actual Feishu data and must never be
# committed. But being invisible to `rg` and `fd` would defeat the entire point of
# mirroring it, and both of them honour .gitignore by default.
#
# This file outranks .gitignore for ripgrep and fd (and is ignored by git itself), so
# the tree stays searchable while staying out of every commit.
!lark-data/
